        "preferentially occur near tissue boundaries or specific anatomical regions."
    ),
    "predicted_outcome": (
        "If the hypothesis is correct, PV cells embedded in PV–PM–PF communities will show significant, coordinated "
        "upregulation of multiple genes associated with signaling or stress responses relative to isolated PV cells, "
