  - PV neighbors: PM (0.336 vs 0.032, 10.34), PW (0.030 vs 0.009, 3.39), PF (0.145 vs 0.054, 2.71)
  - PY neighbors: PX (0.152 vs 0.007, 22.28), PK (0.431 vs 0.037, 11.55), PAA (0.036 vs 0.004, 8.12)
  - PR neighbors: PX (0.060 vs 0.007, 8.78), PK (0.226 vs 0.037, 6.06), PT (0.067 vs 0.016, 4.11).

