    - DE (Mann–Whitney, FDR<0.05):
      - PX interface vs non-interface: 123 significantly upregulated genes.
      - PY interface vs non-interface: 94 significantly upregulated genes.
      - 51 genes upregulated in both PX and PY interface subsets (e.g. ADGRL1, APOE, CA4, CACNA1C, CBLN2, CD34, CD36, CLDN5, CLEC10A, COL2A1).
    - PCA on the shared 51-gene module:
